Add aarch64-apple-ios to RUST_TARGET_TRIPLES

Registers the real device Rust toolchain for workerd's own Bazel-built
Rust crates (lolhtml, workerd-cxx). Buildozer can't express this: it's a
bare Starlark list literal, not a BUILD target.

--- a/build/deps/rust.MODULE.bazel
+++ b/build/deps/rust.MODULE.bazel
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@
     "aarch64-apple-darwin",
     "x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu",
     "x86_64-pc-windows-msvc",
+    "aarch64-apple-ios",
 ]

 rust = use_extension("@rules_rust//rust:extensions.bzl", "rust")
